        ("Review text, images, documents before publication",
         "One review flow with three parallel pipelines: text and caption, image and banner, and PDF/DOCX documents where text is extracted and embedded images are checked."),
        ("Detect tone, language, facts, claims, visual usage, accessibility",
         "Four cited checks: claims and terminology, tone with intent analysis, visual consistency against the kit palette, and accessibility including contrast and alternative text."),
        ("Explain why flagged and identify the guideline or approved source",
         "Each finding shows the issue, the guideline, fact or asset ID, the quoted source, severity, and the suggested fix."),
